// Scene Size: 100

// Debug scene: one natural.water ball, alone, at a small scene size —
// isolates the combination of material.withDisplacement (animated ripple)
// with transmission > 0, which pays for the secondary refraction march on
// top of the displaced-field gradient correction on the primary march.

waterMat, waterColor = natural.water(8, 3.0, 0.15);
ball = sphere(25);
ball.material = waterMat;
ball.color = waterColor;

return ball;
